 r←secret MaskIniValues pairs;b
⍝ `pairs` is a vector of (key value) pairs from an INI file. Returns them with the value replaced by
⍝ "***" when the key contains any of `secret`, parts of key names in upper case (see `SecretIniKeys`).
 r←pairs
 :If 0<≢pairs
     b←secret∘{∨/∨/¨⍺⍷¨⊂⍵}¨1 ⎕C⍕¨⊃¨pairs
     r[⍸b]←{(⊃⍵)'***'}¨b/pairs
 :EndIf
